### 재고 상품 등록
POST http://localhost:25000/api/day1/stocks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "quantity": 20
}

> {%
  client.global.set("stockItemId", response.body.id);
%}

### 재고 조회
GET http://localhost:25000/api/day1/stocks/{{stockItemId}}

### 재고 1개 차감
POST http://localhost:25000/api/day1/stocks/{{stockItemId}}/decrease
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1
}

### 차감 결과 조회
GET http://localhost:25000/api/day1/stocks/{{stockItemId}}

### 잘못된 상품 등록: 400 응답 확인
POST http://localhost:25000/api/day1/stocks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": " ",
  "quantity": -1
}

### 잘못된 차감 수량: 400 응답 확인
POST http://localhost:25000/api/day1/stocks/{{stockItemId}}/decrease
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 0
}

### 재고 부족: 409 응답 확인
POST http://localhost:25000/api/day1/stocks/{{stockItemId}}/decrease
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 999999
}

### 잘못된 상품 ID: 400 응답 확인
GET http://localhost:25000/api/day1/stocks/0

### 존재하지 않는 상품: 404 응답 확인
GET http://localhost:25000/api/day1/stocks/999999
